'''Cat Toaster''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.1 Update|Version 5.1]] gains [[Barrier Breaker]] and increases health, attack power and slow duration. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]].

