==Trivia==
*Cat Projector's description saying that it "worries it might be obsolete thanks to digital video" is likely a reference to the song "[[wikipedia:Video Killed the Radio Star|Video Killed the Radio Star]]".
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Cat Toaster was a part of four other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Grocery Cart (Removed Combo)|Grocery Cart]], [[Electric Home (Removed Combo)|Electric Home]], [[Breakfast (Removed Combo)|Breakfast]] and [[Horror Movies (Combo)|Horror Movies]].
*Catophone was among the units that were given [[Barrier Breaker]] in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].

